PiG
===

PiG is a Go implementation designed to provide behavior corresponding to the Pi coding-agent project:

https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/

Pi is distributed under the MIT License and carries this notice:

Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner

PiG is not an official release of the upstream Pi project. The upstream maintainers do not endorse PiG. PiG preserves upstream copyright and license notices where applicable. See `LICENSE`, `docs/project/PROVENANCE.md`, the repository SPDX metadata, and this notice.

